## Domain backend: the card editability sync also keeps Lakebase disabled
================================================================================

Context:
A second code path re-enabled the unavailable Lakebase radio:
`syncGraphBackendCardEditability()` (run at load and on every body class
change) set `option.disabled` from the read-only state only. Clicking the
greyed-out card then switched the hidden backend select to Lakebase, and Save
stored `graph_backend = lakebase` on a workspace without Lakebase. Found by the
v2 demo dress rehearsal.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-information.js
   `option.disabled` also honours `data-unavailable="1"`.

2. tests/units/front/test_registry_fallback_flag.py
   One more check (red before, green after).

